                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "Short links are handy. But sometimes you’d like to know where one goes before you click, especially when it arrives from someone you don’t know.<br><br>Here’s the trick: copy any Shortly link, <strong>add a “+” to the end</strong>, and paste it into your browser.<br><br>For example:<br><br><strong>shrt.ly/garden-guide+</strong><br><br>Instead of going straight there, you’ll see a page like this:",
