                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "It works with any Shortly link, any day of the year, so you can always see where you’re going first.<br><br><span style=\"display:block;text-align:center\">* * *</span><br>Behind the scenes, we do a lot of work to keep links safe. After all, it’s not just our name people trust when they click, it’s yours.<br><br>Here’s what customers say:<br><br>•&nbsp; “A name our customers trust to click on.” <em>- Priya S.</em><br>•&nbsp; “The one I reach for every time.” <em>- Marcus O.</em><br><br>P.S. Want links that look even more trustworthy? Use your own domain. <a href=\"https://example.com\" style=\"color:#2A6AD8;\">See how custom domains work</a>.",
